## 🧠 OSI Model

| Layer | Name         | Examples                |
| ----- | ------------ | ----------------------- |
| 7     | Application  | HTTP, DNS, FTP          |
| 6     | Presentation | Encryption, compression |
| 5     | Session      | Session management      |
| 4     | Transport    | TCP, UDP                |
| 3     | Network      | IP, ICMP                |
| 2     | Data Link    | Ethernet, MAC           |
| 1     | Physical     | Cables, signals         |

## 🔬 Practical Work

### 1. Ping Packet Analysis

Captured ICMP traffic using Wireshark.

Observed:

* ICMP Echo Request
* ICMP Echo Reply
* Source IP
